<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head') %></head>
<body>
<div class="app">
<%- include('partials/sidebar') %>
<%- include('partials/topbar') %>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-body" style="text-align:center;padding:56px 24px">
        <div style="width:56px;height:56px;margin:0 auto 18px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--accent-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:28px;height:28px">
            <path d="M12 3l2 5 5 2-5 2-2 5-2-5-5-2 5-2 2-5z"/>
            <path d="M19 15l.8 1.9 1.9.8-1.9.8-.8 1.9-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.8.8-1.9z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:8px">AI Suggestions — coming soon</h2>
        <p style="max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--text-2)">
          This requires an ongoing paid AI API connection (a real per-request cost), so it isn't switched on yet.
          Once enabled, this is where AI-generated suggestions will appear — written from the real data already in
          this app, not invented separately from it.
        </p>
        <div class="badge medium" style="margin-top:18px">Requires cost — not yet enabled</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><h3>What will live here</h3></div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="data">
          <thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>What it will do</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Content brief — questions to answer</td>
              <td>AI-suggested questions a page should answer for a given keyword, based on general knowledge of the topic.</td>
              <td><span class="badge medium">Coming soon</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Content brief — competitor coverage</td>
              <td>An AI-written summary of how competitors likely approach a topic, as a starting hypothesis — not a substitute for real competitor data.</td>
              <td><span class="badge medium">Coming soon</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>AI performance summary</td>
              <td>A plain-English written summary of what changed and why, generated from this brand's real Search Console/GA4 numbers already in the app.</td>
              <td><span class="badge medium">Coming soon</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>AI task triage</td>
              <td>A short written priority call across this week's open tasks and alerts, to help decide what to tackle first.</td>
              <td><span class="badge medium">Coming soon</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

<%- include('partials/sidebar-end') %>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
